{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GKpQ6yVDTew2FNaUrVweTV","type":"tool_result","content":"1. **DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 now available on AI Gateway** (17 October): DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 can be called through AI Gateway with a single API key, and it supports image input and request tracing.\n2. **Elorian AI's Glimpse now available on AI Gateway** (16 October): Elorian's Glimpse model is accessible through AI Gateway without a separate provider account, with spend tracking and request traces.\n3. **Perplexity's Decider V1.2 models now available on AI Gateway** (16 October): Perplexity's Decider V1.2 and Decider Flash V1.2 are available through AI Gateway with shared budgets and usage tracking.\n4. **Reflection AI's Beam now available on AI Gateway for free** (16 October): Reflection AI's Beam is free for a limited time on AI Gateway, with spend tracking and request traces.\n5. **Introducing Token Pass** (15 October): Vercel's Token Pass, in early access, offers $80 in monthly credit for featured open-weight models for $30 a month, starting with GLM 5.3 and Kimi K3."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02a0be03-d511-4c69-b12d-48b3de0b2b48","uuid":"aa0271d6-47e1-493d-b8da-3ebfeda447af","timestamp":"2026-10-17T17:40:38.785Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":2555,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"1. **DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 now available on AI Gateway** (17 October): DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 can be called through AI Gateway with a single API key, and it supports image input and request tracing.\n2. **Elorian AI's Glimpse now available on AI Gateway** (16 October): Elorian's Glimpse model is accessible through AI Gateway without a separate provider account, with spend tracking and request traces.\n3. **Perplexity's Decider V1.2 models now available on AI Gateway** (16 October): Perplexity's Decider V1.2 and Decider Flash V1.2 are available through AI Gateway with shared budgets and usage tracking.\n4. **Reflection AI's Beam now available on AI Gateway for free** (16 October): Reflection AI's Beam is free for a limited time on AI Gateway, with spend tracking and request traces.\n5. **Introducing Token Pass** (15 October): Vercel's Token Pass, in early access, offers $80 in monthly credit for featured open-weight models for $30 a month, starting with GLM 5.3 and Kimi K3.","durationMs":3006,"url":"https://vercel.com/changelog"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01GKpQ6yVDTew2FNaUrVweTV","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg8DhsrYvUjXxXtBM6Ceo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The newest entry on Vercel's changelog is **DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 now available on AI Gateway**, dated 17 October. You can call it through AI Gateway with a single API key. It supports image input and request tracing.\n\nThe other recent entries:\n- **16 Oct:** Elorian AI's Glimpse is now on AI Gateway.\n- **16 Oct:** Perplexity's Decider V1.2 and Decider Flash V1.2 are now on AI Gateway.\n- **16 Oct:** Reflection AI's Beam is free for a limited time on AI Gateway.\n- **15 Oct:** Vercel introduced **Token Pass** in early access. It gives $80 in monthly credit for featured open-weight models for $30 a month, starting with GLM 5.3 and Kimi K3.\n\nMost of the recent entries are AI Gateway model additions. Token Pass is the one with a wider product impact."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":522,"cache_read_input_tokens":18526,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":522},"output_tokens":313,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02a0be03-d511-4c69-b12d-48b3de0b2b48","uuid":"683e7ffd-7ad2-483b-864c-a4b0f162e767","timestamp":"2026-10-17T17:40:41.041Z","request_id":"req_011Cg8Dhsbg1VDgAMDofePBX"}
